From: Amphoze <184834775+Amphoze@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] context: connection string from the request's project

getConnectionString returns the string the control plane answered for the request's
project: the read-only one when the call site asks for it and whenever the member's role
is read_only. The connection constants read from the environment, and their built-in
defaults, are removed: outside a request there is no connection string.
---
